NAME
    gcloud alpha number-registry realms - manage discovered and custom realm
        resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha number-registry realms COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage discovered and custom realm resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (ALPHA) Create a realm resource.

     delete
        (ALPHA) Delete a single realm resource.

     describe
        (ALPHA) Gets details of a single realm resource.

     list
        (ALPHA) List realm resources.

     update
        (ALPHA) Update the parameters of a single realm resource.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

